      },
      "message": "refactor(app): split the ahead-walk and digest out of rest.rs\n\nrest.rs had grown to 424 lines, past AGENTS.md's ~400-line limit. The\nwalk over the operations ahead of a consumer (Ahead, path_hash,\nahead_of, digest_of) moves verbatim into rest/ahead.rs, visible only\nto its parent; rest.rs keeps the laws, PriorState, PriorPlan and the\npublic API (prior_digest, prior_state, prior_plan, prior_stale)\nunchanged. No behaviour change: rest.rs 245 lines, rest/ahead.rs 193.\n\nFixes #127\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
